# scripts/opcount: `mexpr bench computed N` runs machines.Run over N
# signals on a machine whose step is computed (step: Both(left, right));
# the cost of one signal is the slope between the two sizes (MACHINE-EXPR,
# the speed rule). The control is the hand Go fold.
unit signal
sizes 400000 2400000
args bench computed {n}
control benchmarks/mexpr/testdata/control
